    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11881" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄπεπτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέσσω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>uncooked: undigested,</i> of food, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				1.26
			</span></i>.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β́,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>de An.</u>
				416b5
			</span></i>, al.; of humouns, <i>crude, unconcocted,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				19
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὖρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Acut.</u>
					42
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Art.</u>
					41
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				384a33
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>GA</u>
				750b25
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				745b20
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					1.5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph., <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				371a3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.495b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>suffering from indigestion,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				7.26.99
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SD</u>
				2.3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ στόμα τῆς γαστρὸς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.Aphr.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					1.45
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χῶραι ἄ.</span> countries <i>where
				fruits ripen ill,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				6.18.12
			</span></i>(
				Comp.
			).</div>
